---
title: "RLS Security Model (kintai-v3: Row Level Security Policies)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_request: database request from role (anon/authenticated/service_role)
    q_request --> q_check_role: determine requesting role
    q_check_role --> q_anon: role = anon
    q_check_role --> q_authenticated: role = authenticated
    q_check_role --> q_service_role: role = service_role

    q_anon --> q_anon_member: access member schema
    q_anon_member --> q_denied_member: ALL REVOKED on member tables
    q_denied_member --> [*]: access denied

    q_anon --> q_anon_attendance: access attendance schema
    q_anon_attendance --> q_anon_temp_reg: temp_registrations SELECT only
    q_anon_temp_reg --> [*]: allowed (Realtime QR subscription)
    q_anon_attendance --> q_anon_rpc: EXECUTE record_attendance_by_card
    q_anon_rpc --> [*]: allowed (SECURITY DEFINER, kiosk direct call)
    q_anon_attendance --> q_anon_other_att: other attendance tables
    q_anon_other_att --> [*]: access denied (ALL REVOKED)

    q_authenticated --> q_auth_member: access member schema
    q_auth_member --> q_auth_read_members: SELECT on members, teams, relations, team_leaders, generation_roles
    q_auth_read_members --> [*]: allowed (read all)
    q_auth_member --> q_auth_update_self: UPDATE on members WHERE auth.uid() = id
    q_auth_update_self --> [*]: allowed (own profile only)

    q_authenticated --> q_auth_attendance: access attendance schema
    q_auth_attendance --> q_auth_own_records: SELECT attendances WHERE auth.uid() = user_id
    q_auth_own_records --> [*]: allowed (own records only)
    q_auth_attendance --> q_auth_att_users: SELECT attendance.users
    q_auth_att_users --> [*]: allowed (read all)

    q_service_role --> q_service_all: ALL operations on ALL tables
    q_service_all --> [*]: allowed (full access)

    note right of q_anon
        INV-001: anon role has minimal access after security fix migration
        INV-002: anon can only SELECT temp_registrations and EXECUTE attendance RPC
        INV-003: FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY applied to all tables (prevents owner bypass)
    end note

    note right of q_authenticated
        INV-004: authenticated users can read ALL member data (no row-level filter)
        INV-005: attendance records filtered to own user_id only
        INV-006: No INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE on attendance tables for authenticated role
    end note

    note right of q_service_role
        INV-007: service_role has unrestricted access - used by admin client
        INV-008: Admin operations (force logout, registration) use service_role via createSupabaseAdminClient
    end note
